<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Sign in - Raspberry Pi Secure Boot Provisioner</title>
    <%view stylesheet %>
    <style>
        .login-container {
            max-width: 360px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 24px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .login-container h1 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin: 0 0 4px;
        }
        .login-container p.login-hint {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .login-container label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 12px 0 4px;
        }
        .login-container input[type="text"],
        .login-container input[type="password"] {
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            padding: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .login-container button {
            margin-top: 20px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
            background: #0066cc;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .login-error {
            background: #fdecea;
            color: #8a1c1c;
            border: 1px solid #f5c2c0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 8px 10px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .nobody-banner {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 24px auto 0;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            background: #a4161a;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .nobody-banner h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 0 0 8px;
        }
        .nobody-banner p, .nobody-banner ul {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .nobody-banner code {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1px 4px;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%view navbar %>
    <%c++ if(@@.get<bool>("nobodyCanSignIn")) { %>
    <section class="nobody-banner" id="nobody-can-sign-in" aria-labelledby="nobody-can-sign-in-title">
        <h2 id="nobody-can-sign-in-title">Nobody can sign in to this station</h2>
        <p>No account in the <strong>rpi-sb-provisioner</strong> group has a password it can sign in with, so settings, images, keys and hooks are out of reach until one does.</p>
        <p>Give the operator account a password, then reload this page:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>On a programming jig, put an <code>rpi-preseed.toml</code> with a <code>[user]</code> <code>name</code> and <code>password</code> on the boot partition and reboot. Raspberry Pi Imager writes this file for you. It only applies if the jig has not applied one before.</li>
            <li>From a shell, run <code>sudo passwd &lt;account&gt;</code>, and <code>sudo adduser &lt;account&gt; rpi-sb-provisioner</code> if it is not in the group.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The station's log names each account and why it cannot sign in: <code>journalctl -u rpi-provisioner-ui</code>.</p>
    </section>
    <%c++ } %>
    <main id="main-content" class="login-container">
        <h1>Raspberry Pi Secure Boot Provisioner</h1>
        <p class="login-hint">Sign in with a system account in the <strong>rpi-sb-provisioner</strong> group.</p>
        <%c++ auto error = @@.get<std::string>("error"); %>
        <%c++ if(!error.empty()) { %>
            <div class="login-error" role="alert"><%c++ $$ << HttpViewData::htmlTranslate(error); %></div>
        <%c++ } %>
        <form method="post" action="/login">
            <input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%c++ $$ << HttpViewData::htmlTranslate(@@.get<std::string>("next")); %>">
            <label for="username">Username</label>
            <input type="text" id="username" name="username" autocomplete="username" autocapitalize="none" required autofocus>
            <label for="password">Password</label>
            <input type="password" id="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            <button type="submit">Sign in</button>
        </form>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
<%view-end%>
